#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the capability of saving sets of simulation result.
#
#The selection to save sets of simulation results is made using the drop-down menu below the Animator: Camera dataset on the right side of the Run Control screen. For this example, the selection is "Keep 5".
#
#This example is the same as Extended Models > Steer Controller with MATLAB.
#
#In one run, the simulation runs with Extensions\Custom_M\Steer_control.m
#
#In another run, Steer_control.m is edited and ran with a different SWA control gain setting (GainStr = 20, instead of 10).
#
#The results are plotted against each other.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

